// The technologies — the Act II research board, one record per tile. The grammar is
// described in `src/README.md` ("The authored roster"). `coord` is the axial position;
// the ring and the pure/hybrid wedge derive from it, so neither is authored. `cost` is the
// research price, an amount of each resource; a tile established at the curtain has none.
// `initial` is the state the act opens on: Foraging and Woodcutting carried over from Act I
// as researched, the four other ring-1 tiles and the five ring-2 openers available, the
// rest locked. `short` is the hex's board label. `effect` and `enables` are the player's
// words. Rings 1–4; ring 0 is the
// foundation and is not a record. The board's rules are `src/README.md`, "The research board".
.{
